SUMMARY:Achieving 360° Visibility in Azure with OpenTelemetry
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nLearn how to instrument Azure-based
  cloud-native workloads using OpenTelemetry across logs\, metrics\, traces
 \, RUM\, and Kubernetes for complete observability.\n\n***\n\n📍 This se
 ssion is a part of the Startup Spotlight series - [Learn more here](https:
 //developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1443/?wt.mc_id=meetup_S-1443_we
 bpage_reactor)
