SUMMARY:Azure Decoded: End-to-End Security for Microsoft Foundry Environme
 nts
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nDon’t just react—stay ahead.\n\
 nDiscover how to monitor\, detect\, and respond to AI-specific security th
 reats using Defender for Cloud AI Foundry’s powerful capabilities.\n\n**
 What you’ll learn:**\n\n* Define access boundaries using Microsoft Entra
  ID and role-based access control (RBAC)\n* Manage project-level permissio
 ns within shared environments\n* Secure secrets with Key Vault and managed
  identities\n* Isolate workloads with managed virtual networks and Private
  Link\n* Enable diagnostic logging for centralized visibility and investig
 ation\n\n**Who should attend:**\nDevelopers\, Security Engineers\, and tec
 hnical professionals who want to learn how to configure policies and alert
 s that keep AI workloads safe and compliant\, giving you full control over
  your cloud environment.\n\n📍 https://aka.ms/SecureMSFTFoundryEnvironme
 nts
